      <name>Reuben Rissler</name>
      <email>pygtk.posting@gmail.com</email>
    </credit>
  </info>

  <title>Invoice history</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Customer</gui><gui>Invoice history</gui></guiseq> opens the
  <gui>Customer History</gui> window, which lists posted invoices and their
  lines.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Choose the <gui>Customer</gui>, or check <gui>All customers</gui>
    to list every invoice. <gui>Total</gui> adds up the invoices
    listed.</p></item>
    <item><p>Select an invoice to see its lines below. Hold <key>Ctrl</key> to
    select several, or check <gui>Select all invoices</gui>; check <gui>All
    products</gui> to see the lines of every invoice.</p></item>
    <item><p>Type into <gui>Search product</gui>, <gui>Search ext name</gui> or
    <gui>Search remark</gui> to narrow the lines down.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <list>
    <item><p>Double click an invoice to open it as it was printed.</p></item>
    <item><p>Right click a line for the <link xref="invoice_hub"/>, the <link
    xref="product_hub"/> of its product, or <gui>View invoice
    pdf</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><p>Drag a line onto an open <link xref="invoice"/> or <link
    xref="job_sheet"/> to add the same product and quantity there.</p></item>
  </list>

</page>
